      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاجَثُوا</span></b>  [<i>They revealed secrets, one to another</i>]: <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاجُثٌ</span> signifies the <i>same as</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَاثٌّ</span>, (K,)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَاحُثٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاجَثُوا</span> [<i>They searched,
investigated, scrutinized,</i> or <i>examined, together</i>]:
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاجُثٌ</span> signifies the same as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَاحُثٌ</span>. (TA.)

